---
import TVLayout from '../layouts/TVLayout.astro'
---

<TVLayout>
  <article class="bio">
    <p class="big-text">
      Hi! I'm <span class="bio__photo" tabindex="0">Likith Shetty</span>. I build
      <button class="button-text js-channel-trigger" data-channel="8"
        >agents</button
      >, retrieval systems and the occasional optimizer.
      <br /><br />Most of what I make ends up on
      <a
        href="https://github.com/LikithSh3tty"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
      >: a support desk that answers out of product docs by meaning rather than
      keywords, a drift watchman that investigates a model before it retrains
      it, an income tracker that does an agency's accounting, and a packer that
      fits the most whole cells into an awkward shape.
      <br /><br />I like systems that admit when they don't know something. Every
      one of those four will tell you it isn't sure rather than guess at an
      answer.
      <br /><br />If you'd like to chat, feel free to reach me by
      <a href="mailto:shettylikith.rajesh@msam.christuniversity.in">e-mail</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</TVLayout>

<style>
  .bio__photo {
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);

    &::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      z-index: var(--layer-me-hover);
      top: calc(100% + 1em);
      left: 1rem;
      width: 14rem;
      padding-bottom: 14rem;
      visibility: hidden;
      background-size: cover;
    }

    &:hover::after,
    &:focus::after {
      background-image: url(/assets/images/me.jpg);
      transition: visibility 0s 0.2s;
      visibility: visible;
    }
  }
</style>
